  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Add an Arch Linux source package recipe with a desktop launcher and AUR metadata.\n- Build the CamCraft UI, CLI, and post processor from the pinned v0.12.1 source archive.\n- Add a manually dispatched Arch container workflow to check the metadata and package contents.\n- Disable makepkg LTO so the bundled Flecs C library links with Arch's Rust toolchain.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `bash -n aur/PKGBUILD`\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`\n- Arch Linux `makepkg --noconfirm` completed successfully in Podman (user verified).\n- Corrected `.SRCINFO` option ordering to match the output shown by the Arch workflow's metadata check.\n\nChangelog: none (packaging only)\n\nRefs #72\n",
